    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-08-11T18:11:46+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-11T18:11:46+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-11T08:41:46Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-11T08:41:46Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A cold front crossing the western parts of SA will continue moving eastwards and cross the rest of the state overnight into the early parts of Wednesday. A ridge of high pressure will then push into SA from the west throughout Wednesday, with the associated high moving over SA on Thursday. The high then gradually drifts southwards to be located in vicinity of Tasmania over the weekend, as it continues extending a ridge across SA.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW009" description="Flinders" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <warning-summary type="sheep_graziers_warning" start-time-local="2026-08-11T16:32:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-13T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-11T07:02:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-12T14:30:00Z">Warning to Sheep Graziers</warning-summary>
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-08-11T18:09:26+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-12T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-11T08:39:26Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-11T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Very high chance of showers west of the ranges, high chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds northwesterly 20 to 30 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-08-12T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-13T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-11T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-12T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers, most likely in the early morning. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Hawker. Winds northwesterly 20 to 30 km/h turning southwesterly before dawn then tending west to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h in the late afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 3 and 7 with daytime temperatures reaching between 12 and 16.</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 10:30am to 2:20pm, UV Index predicted to reach 4 [Moderate]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-08-13T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-14T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-12T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-13T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower near the coast in the morning and afternoon. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of morning frost north of Hawker. The chance of morning fog west of the ranges. Light winds. Overnight temperatures falling to between 2 and 6 with daytime temperatures reaching between 15 and 18.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-08-14T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-15T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-13T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-14T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Light winds becoming east to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 3 and 6 with daytime temperatures reaching between 14 and 19.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-08-15T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-16T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-14T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-15T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Slight chance of a shower on and east of the ranges, near zero chance elsewhere. Winds east to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 4 and 7 with daytime temperatures reaching between 13 and 18.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
